<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Valassis reinitiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Valassis reinitiated.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Wednesday it reinitiated coverage on the shares of Valassis Communications Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The investment firm said it had been restricted from rating the stock because it was involved in a deal concerning Valassis.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Valassis gained one point to 27-1/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
